            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amajambo y’umusiguzi, mwene Dawidi, umwami w’i Yerusalemu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jewe, umusiguzi, nari umwami w’Abisirayeli i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nafashe ingingo yo kwiyegurira kwiga no kurondera kumenya nkoresheje ubwenge mu bintu vyose biri musi y’izuba. Ni umutwaro uremereye Imana yaremetse abantu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabonye ibintu vyose bikorerwa musi y’izuba ari ubusa, ni ukwiruka inyuma y’umuyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nariyumviriye muri jewe nti: “Raba, nararonse kandi naragwije ubwenge kurusha abatwaye i Yerusalemu imbere yanje; kandi nagize ubwenge bwinshi no gutahura kwinshi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze nca mfata ingingo yo kwiga ngo menye ivy’ubwenge, ivy’ubusazi n’ivy’ubupfu, ariko natahuye ko n’ivyo na vyo nyene ari ukwiruka inyuma y’umuyaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
